WEBVTT

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.560
I've never done it before, but I'll do it now.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.390
I've got to be kidding...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:23.200
Shyness and bewilderment, should I add up those experiences?

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.240
Even if I've seen some things, I'll turn a blind eye to them.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.960
They disappear with a flicker.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.140
I imagine the afterimage with an intense movie.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:38.520
I unintentionally blurt out, "I kind of like you."

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.700
I have a temperature and a cold coming on.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.150
It's no-no-normal.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.900
When the contradictions come to an end, a white horse appears.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.650
How strange! How strange!

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.110
You look like the prince!

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.740
The regret from the kiss won't disappear.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:01.750
Why did you give it to me even though it's just puppy love?

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:05.400
We should start over at the least.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:08.330
It's not over. The kiss was passionate.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:12.480
It was just too sudden, so what should we do?

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.040
Quickly, the horse from before!

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:19.900
Should we ride away? Just the two of us? And then leave it?

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:21.770
No, no, no.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:25.730
What I really want is for us to make

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:28.020
a secret plan!

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:52.810
Thank you. Please come again.

00:01:58.240 --> 00:01:59.470
That idiot Kakeru!

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.700
You'll never understand us.

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:05.370
We only...

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.020
...Hope to be loved.

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:26.620
You don't understand our feelings!

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.450
Damn it!

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:32.060
Hey, Gigolo! Let me hit you!

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:33.060
Why?

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:39.090
Having nosebleeds, acting naïve, and playing dirty games with your beautiful sisters every night!

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:41.750
Damn! Forbidden? Forbidden?!

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:44.780
You have some crazy way of thinking!

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.200
Who are you calling crazy?!

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.680
Don't make things up about other's families!

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.560
Even though they're my sisters, they weren't naked.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:55.320
So that's your true nature! It's true that you sleep together on the same bed everyday!

00:02:55.460 --> 00:03:00.300
N-No... E-Even though it's true it doesn't mean-

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.660
Be quiet!

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:07.270
Don't you guys have any delicacy?

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:10.030
I'm immersed in Najimi's fragrance right now,

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:13.960
playing with her in my fantasies.

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:17.450
You're the one with the least delicacy right now.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.400
Speaking of which, isn't Najimi taking too long?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.740
Now that you mention it... Didn't she just go to the convenience store to buy juice?

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:27.100
No. I told her that there's a vending machine nearby.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:28.590
Right, Kochikaze?

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:32.260
Please leave me alone for a while.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:33.810
What, it was only a rejection.

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:37.270
You're always like that.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:44.240
Though I'm a witch, it's painful to be lovelorn. If you're that worried, you can contact her cellphone.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:49.060
Ah... But this is Tenkuuji-san's, right?

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:52.560
No choice then. Let's go find her.

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.000
Eh? I'm going too?

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.080
If I go now, my nose-

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:59.900
All right then. Go comfort the heartbroken Kochikaze.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.010
That sort of thing...

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:03.930
What did you say?!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.780
No... But this...

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:11.120
Comforting a heartbroken girl after she was rejected... Isn't that mean?

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.050
Isn't this the time for a man to make his appearance?

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:15.750
Show your manly side, Gigolo!

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.400
Th-This... Entrusting Kochikaze-san to me...

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.420
But this rare chance...

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.460
No, I can't!

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.630
These evil thoughts...

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.450
What should I do?!

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:31.100
Hey... What are you doing?

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:34.050
I am checking whether there are any coins.

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:37.710
Coins? You didn't buy any juice here, did you?

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:38.690
No.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:43.280
Then why? Are you expecting that someone forgot their change?

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:43.990
Yes.

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:46.470
Why are you laughing?

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:53.620
Because... the tone of your voice and your actions are completely different!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:54.430
Let's see...

00:04:56.580 --> 00:05:00.500
A modest amount... But never mind that.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.070
Which kind of juice would you like? I'll treat you.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:05.570
Got it.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:10.390
Hey... What did you mean by "hope to be loved"?

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:12.260
You heard that?

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:13.830
Did you quarrel with someone?

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:18.580
I am hated by my precious master.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:22.170
M-Master? What kind of person are you?

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:26.130
You!

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:39.650
Ah~ It's Kakeru-chan!

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:44.830
What... Why are you drinking here?

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:49.300
Kakeru-chan, Kakeru-chan! Hey, listen, listen!

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.280
Hey, don't pull so hard.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:57.480
Najimi bought juice, one that wasn't carbonated.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:01.000
And then, I drank it. And then... And yet...

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:08.950
Hey, Najimi! What's wrong? Why are you crying?

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:14.470
It should have been with Kakeru-chan, so I took it seriously.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.490
It's Kakeru-chan's fault!

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:21.160
Well, not that it really hurts.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:24.360
That hurt! Stop it! My masochist side will awaken!

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:26.400
Najimi?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.900
What's wrong?

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:31.800
Does Kakeru-chan love Najimi?

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:36.240
This again... The drunkard doesn't change.

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:37.910
Yeah, I love you.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:42.980
Then, then, take Najimi...

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:43.900
on a date.

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:49.170
Date? You know... Even if you're drunk, be more serious.

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:52.050
Let's go on a date! Okay?

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:56.010
If you don't promise that you will, I'll vomit here.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.320
I get it! I get it! Just stop!

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:00.190
I'll date you.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:05.300
I did it! A date with Kakeru-chan!

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.400
Hey! Anyway, go back to the room.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.530
Also, stop that weird laughing.

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:21.080
Hey, don't fall sleep! Are you a baby?

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.580
You're an aluminum Akikan, right?

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.380
Do you want to fight me?

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.200
Akikan?

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.420
Is that an insult, Steel Can?

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.640
What? Could it be that you just took your human form?

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:36.730
What of it?

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:41.280
Really? No wonder a new Girlish like you doesn't know.

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:43.850
Besides you're hated by your owner.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.370
Both of us are alike. Really.

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.240
It's tough having a weird owner.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.150
Isotonic sword.

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:56.320
I won't forgive those who insult my owner.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.010
Melon barrier!

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.860
So suddenly? You're the worst.

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:04.710
Can't aluminum cans get a joke? Are you an idiot?

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:09.500
I don't want to hear that from a steel can who insults her own owner and doesn't have a sense of honor.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:15.430
Aluminum cans have a large capacity, but are weak and easily crushed.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:22.480
Steel cans have a smaller capacity and less juice, but have the same price as us.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.270
This is what they call a rip-off.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:25.770
You irritate me.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:27.150
You anger me.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.210
Someone like you...

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:30.110
You...

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.150
I'll turn you into scrap metal!

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:33.400
Melo-Melo!

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:38.000
It will be troublesome if we're seen.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.740
Let's go somewhere else.

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.650
Wait! What are you doing?

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:49.540
No matter who they are, I won't forgive anyone who stands in my way.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:53.670
If they interrupt me, I just need to remove them.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.760
You unreasonable dented can!

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.260
Dented can?

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:01.510
Try to catch me if you can!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.850
What do you mean by "dented can"? Are you making a fool of me?

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:10.270
If it's here...

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.770
I won't miss next time.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.860
Melo-Melo!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:20.700
Wait!

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.690
My head hurts...

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.660
Let's take a bath together and you'll be fine.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.110
Come on, let's go.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.170
E-Eh, the two of you together?

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.840
T-This is wrong no ma-

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:38.050
Amaji!

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.030
I'm sorry.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.850
Come. Quickly.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.190
Let's go.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:53.440
Hey, Melon. Let's go to school.

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:58.680
Hey, Melon.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:10.210
Next is the Sports Corner. The professional baseball game yesterday...

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.340
Look! The Taiga team won yesterday.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:17.820
I'm only an empty can, right?

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:20.380
Once the can is empty, I just get thrown away.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.260
Regarding the Taiga team's game...

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:25.810
What?!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:30.910
Shut up! I'm still worried about her! I have no choice.

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.360
Don't tell me that Kakeru plans to peep at them?

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:38.430
Yuriri, does it feel good here?

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.400
Najimi, it feels good.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:42.570
Being massaged by Najimi...

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:44.810
My stiff shoulders are grateful.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:47.330
Really, Yuriri.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:51.620
Oh yeah! I'll get some soap. It will be more comfortable that way.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:56.250
Hm, the sample I got is around here...

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.280
Kakeru-chan... Are you going back?

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:02.800
Yeah, see you on Monday.

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:07.680
Um... Kakeru-chan, do you remember the date that we promised?

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:10.610
Oh, that.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.300
Well, tomorrow's Sunday.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.000
I don't want it to be that soon.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:19.650
Why? Isn't it better to buy the things you want sooner?

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:24.160
It's not like that. I want to wait for that day slowly.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:29.710
Then the next Sunday. That's fine, right?

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:32.160
Let's discuss the details at school. See you.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:34.920
See you later.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.350
That guy is...

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:52.350
The fact that he's here means that the steel can is also...

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:56.480
Budoko!

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:58.460
Why did you run away all of a sudden?

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.280
Misaki, you know...

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.030
You can't do that.

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.890
It's dangerous to use this on the street.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.090
That guy...

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.670
Come, let's go to the park.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:11.100
I'll make up the time I couldn't spend with you by playing a lot on the weekend.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:11.830
A lot?

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:13.830
A lot.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.630
I want to play a lot with Misaki!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.080
Melon?

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:29.890
Kakeru...

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:32.060
Hey, that injury!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:33.750
What happened?

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:34.870
Kakeru, it hurts!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:35.850
Sorry.

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:38.650
Really, what happened?

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:43.480
This has nothing to do with you. I'm free to fight whomever I want.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:44.430
What does that mean?

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:47.990
Wait, fight? Did you fight with an aluminum can?

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:50.140
It's got nothing to do with you!

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.360
It does have something to do with me.

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:53.980
Then why are you here?

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:54.870
Because!

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.420
Because I don't...

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:02.190
I don't have anywhere else to go...

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.990
Melon... You...

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:12.150
So that's it. Do you like sleeping with your head on my lap that much?

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.790
Is it? Is it? Perverted, perverted.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:18.960
What are you talking about? I've never used your lap as a pillow.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.650
Don't be shy, don't be shy.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.690
Well, there aren't any girls in the world who wouldn't go crazy-

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:31.940
Idiot.

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:37.460
Well, if you're that energetic, you must be all right.

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:45.170
Come inside. At least let me treat your wounds.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:53.380
This time it's a sports drink's Akikan?

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:55.710
So, where did she go?

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:59.980
I don't know. But wouldn't she return to her owner?

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:03.130
She's a girl with a strong sense of loyalty.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:08.610
Is she? If so, the owner may learn of the Akikan Elect and want to participate.

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.410
They'll come for me.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:16.160
Melon... Are you still thinking of defeating the aluminum cans?

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.730
Why do you still keep fighting?

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:21.420
I... I just...

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:25.800
I see. Then I have no choice.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.760
We'll also participate in the Akikan Elect.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:31.760
And those are the basics.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:36.060
Then, use this to locate steel cans,

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.310
the Akikan Radar.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.830
I can't believe these sorts of things.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.980
After all, cans' turning into girls and needing to fight...

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:45.650
It's not that difficult.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:51.410
You just need to reach out with your hand and grasp this new reality.

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:10.780
We'll be excusing ourselves now.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:11.530
Airin-kun.

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.230
It's Kizaki.

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:15.570
Excuse us.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.810
My honey!

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.520
Give me a hot kiss to celebrate our reunion!

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:28.570
I don't hate this sort of play.

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:32.860
So, was what you said on the telephone true?

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.890
We're going to participate in the Akikan Elect.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.640
But Kakeru doesn't want to fight, right?

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:41.980
Yeah, but don't misunderstand.

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.000
We're participating but not fighting.

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:49.790
Listen well, Melon. If an Akikan shows up, let me talk to her.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:53.110
It's for the best if she loses her will to fight.

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:54.570
But, I...

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.640
You don't want to fight someone who doesn't want to, right?

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:03.110
Melon, avoid fighting if you can. Negotiations come first.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:06.630
That means you have no will to fight.

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.940
Is it all right to say such a thing in front me?

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:18.910
Oh well. Because you're so cute and I'm in a lively mood, I'll pretend I didn't hear that.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.910
Take this.

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:22.600
What is it?

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:25.510
This is a radar which locates other Akikan.

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:27.690
It can catch aluminum waves.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:28.880
Aluminum waves?

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:34.810
The steel and aluminum Girlish emit different electric waves.

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:38.100
We call these aluminum waves and steel waves.

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:42.050
Your radar can only detect aluminum waves.

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:44.830
So when the enemy makes a move...

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:48.480
There are no enemies. We don't plan on fighting!

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:51.960
Owner.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.940
Why are you so sad?

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:57.700
If there's anything that I can do-

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.930
Don't say anything. Why did you involve me?

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.370
Najimi just wants to be normal...

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:06.700
Just as I thought!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:07.880
What do you mean?

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:13.530
As a result of my investigation, I found something new about the Akikan Elect.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:15.470
Really? What did you find?

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:20.870
Don't be shocked. Listen, "elect" in English means "erection."

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:23.200
"Erection"? What is "erection"?

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:29.440
Good question! Are you ready? An erection is from a man's soul, his root!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:35.140
In short his penis! In Japan, the size of the penis is being examined and improved upon!

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:39.220
That is an erection! An erection is of a true man!

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:43.810
But an erection has no relationship with an Akikan.

